<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Dear {!Lead.OwnerFirstName},&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><p class="MsoListParagraph"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;, sans-serif;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">The lead {!Lead.Name} from {!Lead.Company} has been assigned to you as the Account Owner or Team Member.</span>&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">Be sure to follow the "Guidance for success". If this is an Unclaimed Lead be sure to Claim it and start attempting to contact the Lead.</span></p></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Click&nbsp;</span><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="{!Lead.Link}">here</a></font><a href="{!Lead.Link}"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</span></a><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">to visit this lead record in SFDC</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><br></span></div><div style=""><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><div style="">If the Lead has been Qualified, be sure to read the notes, PACTT information and activities to familiarize yourself with the Lead.</div><div style=""><br></div><div style="">Actions upon receipt of this notification:</div><div style="">1. Claim the Lead to change sales stage to “Sales Accepted Lead”.</div><div style="">2. A call or email must be logged within 1 business day of receipt of this notification.</div><div style="">3. If contact is established and the lead is considered to have an Opportunity project to enter the Sales Process</div><div style="">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; a. Be sure to convert the Opportunity into the existing Account.</div><div style="">4. If an Opportunity for Sales is not established, disposition the Lead with the proper Sub Status.</div><div style=""><br></div><div style="">If not an opportunity at this time, and if desired, you can convert this lead to a contact for potential contact in the future.</div><div style="">Leads move to a terminated state if there is no activity for 30 days and 90 days since the creation date.</div><div style=""><br></div><div style="">Good Luck!</div></font></span></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>